petrus-argparse
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package ports the parts of CPython 3.14's argparse module that the
reference command lines use: Petrus's process entry points
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus, pinned under upstream/petrus) and
Hamsterdan's (https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan, pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan). That covers parsing, abbreviations, subcommands,
usage and help formatting with the _colorize theme, and the error messages.

